<title>PORTUGAL: Dutch PM praises Portugal's economic progress.</title>
<headline>Dutch PM praises Portugal's economic progress.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch Prime Minister Wim Kok said that Portugal had made excellent progress in economic and fiscal policy.</p>
<p>&quot;I really admire the way in which Portugal has been able to make progress in budgetary discipline and economic policy. It has come from far away to having an excellent performance,&quot; Kok told a news conference in Lisbon.</p>
<p>Kok was visiting Lisbon as part of preparations for a European Union summit in Amsterdam next month.</p>
</text>
